      "id": 22,
      "title": "A-side: zta_probe_requests_total by code",
      "description": "The caller's own view, at the probe interval set in deploy/workloads/service-a.yaml (20ms). A flat line here during a trial is a stalled prober \u2014 a contaminated run, because T8 comes off this loop.",
